## AI-PLC Agent Instructions

### Operating Principles

- Use local workspace files as the primary source of truth.
- Treat external systems as optional integration targets, not required runtime dependencies.
- Record durable knowledge in the environment-local knowledge store:
  - Claude Code: `.claude/wiki/`, `.claude/memory.md`, `.claude/user.md`, `.claude/soul.md`
  - Codex: `.codex/wiki/`, `.codex/memory.md`, `.codex/user.md`, `.codex/soul.md`

### 4-Stage Pipeline

| Stage | Claude Code | Codex |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| Collection | `.claude/skills/ai-plc/01-collection/SKILL.md` | `.codex/skills/ai-plc/01-collection/SKILL.md` |
| Inception | `.claude/skills/ai-plc/02-inception/SKILL.md` | `.codex/skills/ai-plc/02-inception/SKILL.md` |
| Construction | `.claude/skills/ai-plc/03-construction/SKILL.md` | `.codex/skills/ai-plc/03-construction/SKILL.md` |
| Operation | `.claude/skills/ai-plc/04-operation/SKILL.md` | `.codex/skills/ai-plc/04-operation/SKILL.md` |

### Agents

Use these names as task roles regardless of tool. In Claude Code they map to `.claude/agents/*.md`; in Codex they are role conventions referenced from `AGENTS.md`.

| Agent | File | Trigger |
|-------|------|---------|
| `researcher` | `.claude/agents/researcher.md` | 「調査して」「リサーチして」 |
| `quality-reviewer` | `.claude/agents/quality-reviewer.md` | 「レビューして」「チェックして」 |
| `pm-analyst` | `.claude/agents/pm-analyst.md` | 「進捗を分析して」「リスクを評価して」 |
| `progress-syncer` | `.claude/agents/progress-syncer.md` | 「進捗を同期して」 |

### Definition of Done

1. Deliverable files exist at the specified path
2. `backlog.yaml` status is updated to `completed` with `completed_at` date
3. YAML files parse without error
4. Post-Deliver Propagation completed (context.yaml, memory.md, wiki/)
5. External sync is skipped unless explicitly configured

